=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;a) Select the Star=
t button, then select Settings &gt;=0A                                        =
            Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer or=0A            =
                                        scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                    =
                            &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to find nearby printers, then=
 choose the=0A                                                    one you w=
ant to use, and select Add device. If you want=0A                          =
